            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Bagel Meter 1.3.1

- In Compact, the right-hand column now always shows when each account resets ("Resets Sat 9:00 AM"), or "Back …" in red when it's zeroed. Same for your friends' tables.
- Files inside the app are readable for everyone on the Mac (cleaner updates).
]]></description>
